A user can register as a Rider or Driver.
A driver can change their availability:
AVAILABLE
BUSY
OFFLINE
A rider can request a ride by providing:
Pickup location
Destination
Vehicle type
The system should find nearby available drivers.
The system should support different driver-matching strategies, such as:
Nearest driver
Highest-rated driver
A driver can accept or reject a ride request.
Once a driver accepts, that driver should become BUSY.
A ride should have states:
REQUESTED
DRIVER_ASSIGNED
DRIVER_ARRIVED
STARTED
COMPLETED
CANCELLED
The rider or driver can cancel a ride.
Once the ride is completed, calculate the fare based on distance/time and vehicle type.
The rider should be able to make a payment.
The system should maintain ride history for riders and drivers.
Different vehicle types should be supported:
Bike
Sedan
SUV
The system should allow different pricing strategies, such as normal pricing and surge pricing

